  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5504.07 Registration Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5504.07 Registration Fee. A sexual offender or offender against children shall pay an annual fee of $50.00 within 10 days of the sexual offender or offender against children’s registration during the month of his or her birth date.\n\nSource. #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
